// Put the sign-up rules in columns and the sign-up forms in rows, check the rules one by one, and show which forms to refuse.
// Under a failing form, write the rule it fails and the value typed in.
judge Which sign-ups to refuse

rule mail as Email [value: has @]
rule pw as Password [value: 8 or more letters]
rule age as Age [value: 13 or over]
rule terms as Terms [value: agreed]

case Sato [note: everything filled in]
case Suzuki [note: short password]
  fail pw: 5 letters
case Takahashi [note: typo in the email]
  fail mail: takahashi.example.jp
case Tanaka [note: 12 and did not agree]
  fail age: 12
  fail terms: not agreed
